  "historyNote": "#2205, eff 12-12-82; ss by #2504, eff 10-12-83; ss by #3181, eff 1-22-86; ss by #4061, eff 5-29-86; ss by #5399, eff 5-21-92; ss by #5912, eff 10-14-94; ss and moved by #6690, eff 2-21-98 (see Rev 704.03); ss by #6750, eff 5-19-98; ss by #6807, INTERIM, eff 7-21-98, EXPIRES: 11-18-98; ss by #6870, eff 10-20-98; ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 709.01); ss by #13432, eff 8-12-22; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
